&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dataiku.com/?utm_source=newswire&amp;amp;utm_medium=press-release&amp;amp;utm_campaign=PlatformforAISuccess&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Dataiku&lt;/a&gt; is the Platform for AI Success, the enterprise orchestration layer for building, deploying, and governing AI. In a single environment, teams design and operate analytics, machine learning, and AI agents with the transparency, collaboration, and control enterprises require. Sitting above data platforms, cloud infrastructure, and AI services, Dataiku connects the full enterprise AI stack - empowering organizations to run AI across multi-vendor environments with centralized governance.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The world’s leading companies rely on Dataiku to operationalize AI and run it as a true business performance engine delivering measurable value. For more, visit the Dataiku &lt;a href=&quot;https://blog.dataiku.com/?_gl=1*17edvf4*_ga*MjA1Mjk5NzY4OC4xNjY3MjMyMDUz*_ga_B3YXRYMY48*MTY2OTA1MDY5NS4xMi4xLjE2NjkwNTA2OTguNTcuMC4w&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;blog&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/dataiku/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/dataiku&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/dataiku&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re seeking a Junior User Experience Designer to join our product team, developers, and designers in building our Data Science Platform, with a focus on dedicated Solutions for customers. This role requires skills in user research, experience design, usability, and interaction design. The Junior UX Designer will work closely with senior designers, Product, and Development teams based in Paris to understand business requirements, gather the best possible research, and help create and promote standard practices for our platform. You&#39;ll actively participate in all stages of product development, contributing to presentations of findings and recommendations for improvements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Dataiku Data Science Platform&#39;s ambition is to be the most ergonomic Data Science platform that addresses citizen data science needs to fully custom advanced analytics. At Dataiku, you will work with a unique team of Data Scientists, Developers, UX Designers, UX researchers, and Product Managers. As part of this group, you will have the chance to learn how to create tailored solutions for industries and businesses that are both friendly and powerful.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the design, execution, and analysis of concept validation studies with supervision&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research consumer behaviors, expectations, and benchmark competitors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in preparing and delivering presentations of findings and recommendations to stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate design decisions and UX recommendations for feature concepts into wireframes and interactive prototypes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and test user flows and low-fidelity prototypes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with engineers to understand technical constraints and overcome design challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the maintenance of our styleguide and our in-house design language&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research and stay current with trends in UX and design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively learn to understand the constraints and needs of various industries (e.g., finance, health, etc).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in design-related software (e.g., Figma, Miro, or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;0 to 2 years of relevant UX design experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of user-centered design approaches and tools (including wireframes, journey maps, and user flows).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic knowledge of front-end technologies (HTML, CSS, JavaScript).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and ability to provide rationale for design decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Portfolio featuring student or professional examples of interaction design work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree (BS or MS) in Human-Computer Interaction, Psychology, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience integrating user feedback into design practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working collaboratively in a design team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with professional software development environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity for complex technical systems and data-driven products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot; data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;#LI-FR1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What are you waiting for!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;At Dataiku, you&#39;ll be part of a journey to shape the ever-evolving world of AI. We&#39;re not just building a product; we&#39;re crafting the future of AI. If you&#39;re ready to make a significant impact in a company that values innovation, collaboration, and your personal growth, we can&#39;t wait to welcome you to Dataiku! And if you’d like to learn even more about working here, you can visit our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/dataiku/&quot;&gt;Dataiku LinkedIn page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Our practices are rooted in the idea that everyone should be treated with dignity, decency and fairness. Dataiku also believes that a diverse identity is a source of strength and allows us to optimize across the many dimensions that are needed for our success. Therefore, we are proud to be an equal opportunity employer.&amp;nbsp;All employment practices are based on business needs, without regard to race, ethnicity, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, religion, age, neurodiversity, disability status, citizenship, veteran status or any other aspect which makes an individual unique or protected by laws and regulations in the locations where we operate. This applies to all policies and procedures related to recruitment and hiring, compensation, benefits, performance, promotion and termination and all other conditions and terms of employment. If you need assistance or an accommodation, please contact us at: &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;postings-link&quot; ----------
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Protect yourself from fraudulent recruitment activity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Dataiku will never ask you for payment of any type during the interview or hiring process. Other than our video-conference application, Zoom, we will also never ask you to make purchases or download third-party applications during the process. If you experience something out of the ordinary or suspect fraudulent activity, please review our page on identifying and reporting fraudulent activity&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dataiku.com/legal/dataiku-recruitment-scams/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;EQT is looking for an Applied AI Lead — a delivery-focused engineering leader who brings together technical depth, product instinct, and the credibility to partner with investment professionals, operators, and engineers to turn generative AI from prototype into production. This role sits at the heart of EQT&#39;s ambition to become the most AI-literate firm in private markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will lead EQT&#39;s Applied AI function, a multidisciplinary team of applied AI engineers, ML engineers, and full-stack builders shipping high-impact generative AI products across Client, Investment Teams, and Fund/Group. The team consumes Tech Foundations&#39; shared AI platform while owning lightweight tooling and operational practices to move with speed.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will lead a team of engineers deployed on high-impact projects to quickly drive results within both engineering and business teams. You will lead with craft, actively contributing to assignments alongside your leadership duties and you will act as a catalyst, helping engineering teams accelerate AI delivery and maximizing AI impact across business teams. You set the standard for quality and delivery across the team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, mentor, and grow a multidisciplinary Applied AI team with clear expectations for delivery quality and technical craft.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the Applied AI roadmap in close alignment with business stakeholders and value stream teams; stay attuned to emerging AI capabilities and evaluate where new models, agents, or tooling unlock fresh value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Tech Foundations, Product, Data, and Security teams to ensure Applied AI products integrate cleanly and responsibly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the senior AI partner to EQT&#39;s business lines — working directly with investment professionals and leaders to translate opportunities into concrete deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive adoption of shipped products through enablement, demonstrations, training, and active feedback loops with end users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track the AI frontier and apply fresh thinking to raise the bar on what EQT can build.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measure and communicate business impact with rigour — instrumenting both engineering productivity gains and user adoption — and hire engineers who understand that judgment about AI output, decomposition skills, and willingness to change workflows matter more than framework credentials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are a thoughtful, delivery-oriented leader who combines technical depth with business fluency to navigate private markets. You bring collaborative leadership, sound judgment, and relentless curiosity about where AI creates genuine value in PE.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring (must-have):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Credibility:&lt;/strong&gt; At least 10 years in software or ML/AI engineering, with 3–5 years in a leadership capacity managing teams or strategic delivery in applied AI, ML product, or AI platform environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Demonstrated AI Leverage &amp;amp; Outcomes:&lt;/strong&gt; Concrete evidence of AI-driven productivity gains: a specific product, workflow, or internal tool you shipped with AI; a measurable before/after (latency, throughput, manual-work elimination); and how you measured it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Willingness to Abandon Habits for Better Tooling:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ve changed your mind on how you write AI systems because a new approach or model capability made the old one obsolete. You ship what works now, not what worked last year, and you bring that standard to how you lead.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working Knowledge of Private Equity &amp;amp; Deal Workflow:&lt;/strong&gt; Genuine operational fluency in PE — deal cycles, investment decision-making, portfolio workflows, or comparable high-stakes professional services. You translate vague &quot;investment teams struggle with analysis&quot; into shippable features and know where AI actually applies vs. distraction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measurement &amp;amp; Instrumentation:&lt;/strong&gt; You cultivate a culture of transparency and clarity. You measure impact and productivity not just for dashboards, but to empower your team, identify where we win, and remove barriers to success. You believe that rigorous, data-informed insights create fairness and accountability—enabling you to hire, promote, and develop top-quartile talent who value ‘Owning It’.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder &amp;amp; Cross-Functional Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ve translated ambiguous business needs into shippable AI products in close partnership with non-technical stakeholders. You lead across engineering, product, data, and security without formal authority. You&#39;ve rolled out internal platforms or shared services and know how to drive adoption.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Judgment About What&#39;s Real vs. Hype:&lt;/strong&gt; You follow AI research actively but skeptically — testing whether new capabilities solve problems you care about. You experiment thoughtfully and bring a craft-oriented mindset to your team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comfort in Ambiguity &amp;amp; Distributed Environments:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ve operated effectively in large, complex organisations across time zones, unclear ownership, and shifting priorities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience in private equity operations, investing, or portfolio company engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with data governance, security, and AI compliance frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of building strong developer experiences and high-leverage internal tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience enabling AI adoption at an organisational scale, including training, change management, or community building.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with AI infrastructure or platform team environments (beyond applied AI delivery).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A public track record of open-source contributions, technical writing, or speaking on AI systems design or engineering practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;EQT offers a rare opportunity to shape how one of the world&#39;s leading private markets firms applies AI at scale. You&#39;ll work alongside sharp minds in finance and technology, with the mandate and resources to build something genuinely impactful. We&#39;re committed to a high-trust environment where what you deliver matters more than tenure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Benefits Notice We offer a competitive total rewards package including base salary, determined based on the role, experience, skill set, and location. Eligible employees may also receive discretionary incentive compensation, awarded in recognition of individual performance and company results. EQT provides a comprehensive benefits offering designed to support employee wellbeing, development, and work-life balance. Benefits include paid time off, parental leave, wellbeing and wellness support, flexible working arrangements, and learning and development opportunities. Benefits are effective from the first day of employment and may vary by location and role.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Inclusion at&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt; EQT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Our vision for EQT employees is to build high performing &amp;amp; engaged teams. Our competitive edge comes from fostering an environment where every individual feels valued, empowered, and motivated to drive business impact. Our commitment to inclusion is not just about fairness; We understand and believe that being a great place to work drives the best performance.At EQT, inclusion is a business imperative and it&#39;s embedded into our talent strategy, decision-making, and culture to ensure that every individual and team operates at their full potential. By doing so, we unlock better collaboration, stronger innovation, and superior investment outcomes.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;About&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt; EQT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;EQT is a purpose-driven global investment organization focused on active ownership strategies. With a Nordic heritage and a global mindset, EQT has a track record of over three decades of developing companies across multiple geographies, sectors and strategies. EQT has investment strategies covering all phases of a business’ development, from start-up to maturity. EQT has EUR ‌​​270 billion in total assets under management (EUR ‌​​‌141 billion in fee-generating assets under management), within two business segments – Private Capital and Real Assets.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;With its roots in the Wallenberg family’s entrepreneurial mindset and philosophy of long-term ownership, EQT is guided by a set of strong values and a distinct corporate culture. EQT manages and advises funds and vehicles that invest across the world with the mission to future-proof companies, generate attractive returns and make a positive impact with everything EQT does. EQT has offices in more than 25 countries across Europe, Asia and the Americas and has more than 1,900 employees.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;More info: &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;http://www.eqtgroup.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://www.eqtgroup.com&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;www.eqtgroup.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;Follow EQT on&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;http://www.linkedin.com/company/508278&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://www.linkedin.com/company/508278&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://twitter.com/eqt&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://twitter.com/eqt&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCPkDSny24x66By2G2_B1Okw/featured&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCPkDSny24x66By2G2_B1Okw/featured&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/eqtgroup/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/eqtgroup/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
